## Main Commands

All commands run through Docker.

### Installation
```bash
docker compose up -d
docker compose exec app cargo build --workspace
```

### Development
```bash
docker compose exec app cargo run -p {{BINARY_CRATE}}
docker compose exec app cargo watch -x "run -p {{BINARY_CRATE}}"
docker compose exec app cargo check --workspace
```

### Database
```bash
# Run migrations
docker compose exec app sqlx migrate run

# Create migration
docker compose exec app sqlx migrate add {{MIGRATION_NAME}}

# Refresh the offline query cache (commit .sqlx/)
docker compose exec app cargo sqlx prepare --workspace
```

### Tests
```bash
# All tests
docker compose exec app cargo nextest run --workspace --all-features

# Doc tests
docker compose exec app cargo test --workspace --doc

# With coverage (cargo-llvm-cov)
docker compose exec app cargo llvm-cov nextest --workspace --fail-under-lines 80
```

### Quality
```bash
# Format and lint
docker compose exec app cargo fmt --all -- --check
docker compose exec app cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings

# Security
docker compose exec app cargo audit
docker compose exec app cargo deny check

# Full local CI
docker compose exec app ./scripts/ci.sh
```

